on  don't matter how many men they they  bring here is that don't matter for us  our machine guns can shoot what hundred  thousand rounds a minute if you shoot 5  or 50 I don't think our machine Gunners  will be tired  Ukrainian military says it's winning  back territory in the East bit by bit  day by day  so far evidence on the battlefield at  least suggests moscow's military  response is yet to come  Charles Strafford Al Jazeera eastern  Ukraine
 

